    "skill": "shared/tell-dont-ask",
    "description": "A getter whose whole body returns the object's own mutable collection, untouched: every caller holds the same one and may add, remove or reorder it behind the object's back.",
    "rule": "An object keeps its own collection: hand out something a caller cannot change, and give the object the methods callers were reaching in to use.",
    "suggestion": "Return a copy or a read-only view of the collection, and add the methods the callers were doing by hand (`addLine()`, `totalFor()`, `without(line)`)."
